, masterminded by a new team of criminals they never saw coming: The Bad Girls.","description_fr":"Un loup, un serpent, une tarentule, un requin et un piranha sont une ancienne bande de criminels repentis tentant une réinsertion dans la société. Cependant, leur mauvaise réputation les précède et ils peinent à trouver du travail. Lorsqu'une série de cambriolages sont perpétrés dans la ville, ils en deviennent les principaux suspects. Pour prouver leurs bonnes intentions, ils offrent à la commissaire de police d'utiliser leurs habiletés uniques pour identifier le véritable coupable.","poster":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w500/5kPBoixwBx2WBZPd14umvXfU3ib.jpg","backdrop":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w780/jvpkBenB6hv19WWYVlaiow8zklq.jpg","has_poster":true,"rating":7.6,"vote_count":953,"age_rating":"PG","year":"2025","release_date":"2025-07-24","runtime_minutes":104,"status":"Released","country":"الولايات المتحدة","language":"الإنجليزية","genres":["عائلي","كوميديا","جريمة","مغامرة","رسوم متحركة","حركة","أفلام"],"genre_keys":["family","comedy","crime","adventure","animation","action"],"similar":["tv15260","tv62211","tv51817","tv4686","tv68073","tv44593","mv1287536","tv67424"],"director":"بيير بريفيل","cast":[{"name":"سام روكويل","character":"Wolf (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/afYhNpLwpa65Yy0Q0g00FNFhzx5.jpg"},{"name":"مارك مارون","character":"Snake (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/xzRBK8hR6693VQWmr3Wx2UVoA5P.jpg"},{"name":"أوكوافينا","character":"Tarantula (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/l5AKkg3H1QhMuXmTTmq1EyjyiRb.jpg"},{"name":"كريغ روبنسون","character":"Shark (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/mTyTrOWUSOBJMOlDpnd4OYx7FlJ.jpg"},{"name":"أنتوني راموس","character":"Piranha (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/gCeRfH3aetIpZwKxe8Wl4ZYcQg5.jpg"},{"name":"زازي بيتز","character":"Diane Foxington (voice)","profile_image":"https://image.tmdb.org/t/p/w185/sgxzT5